# `stdev` and `variance` are the sample statistics (n - 1).
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/reordered/*.csv'
| summarize v = variance(score), s = stdev(score), one = stdev(iff(id == 1, score, long(null)))
---- expected
v     | s                 | one
real  | real              | real
